OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FPower cuts are hitting tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of properties across England,
OL,9,FScotland and the island of Ireland
OL,11,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,12,Facross large parts of Scotland,
OL,13,Fnorthern England and parts of Northern
OL,14,FIreland
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
