OL,3,ABurnham open to 'honest discussion' on
OL,4,AEU free movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister says he would
OL,7,Fwelcome an "honest discussion" about
OL,8,Fthe prospect of returning to free
OL,9,Fmovement between the UK and European
OL,10,FUnion.
OL,12,FSpeaking to the Sunday Times, Andy
OL,13,FBurnham said he wants to pursue a new
OL,14,Ftype of relationship with Brussels,
OL,15,Fpotentially including full EU
OL,16,Fmembership or joining the single
OL,17,Fmarket, which would require free
OL,18,Fmovement.
OL,20,F"I think you have to have a very
OL,21,Ffactual, quite evidence-based debate
OL,22,Fabout this," he told the newspaper.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
